/target

# Vision-tool scratch space (screenshots for verification runs).
.dsh-vision-router/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-specific / personal data. Never publish these:
# `local/` holds this machine's real paths (AltRun install, build toolchain,
# the user's own command inventory) plus the word list the pre-commit hook
# blocks on. Docs refer to placeholders and point here instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
local/

# Third-party code that must not be redistributed: another author's AHK rewrite
# of AltRun. Kept on disk for reference, excluded from the repository.
docs/ALTRun.ahk

# Launcher data that may end up next to the repo during experiments.
*.redb
mxrun.log
mxrun-export.json
ShortCutList*.txt

# 打包脚本的中间日志（tools/package-portable.ps1 写的）。里面是本机绝对路径，
# 而且是每次打包都会重写的临时文件 —— 2026-10-14 忘了忽略，pre-commit 钩子当场拦下。
.package-*.log

# 打包产物（便携 zip 等）：不进仓库，改用 GitHub Release 分发
dist/

# 图标设计的过程稿（豆包的工作目录：多轮候选图、派生脚本、白底母版的旁支变体）。
# 15 MB，且脚本里写着本机绝对路径（会把 pre-commit 钩子点着），只留在磁盘上；
# 入库的是 `icon/`（母版 + 生成的尺寸集 + .ico）和 `assets/`（构建真正 include 的 raw）。
.creative-design/
